          <change when="2017-11-20T05:56:51-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/agi.mihalyko">Commit - Added BL 8 355 to l. 10 and 18. In l. 18 Sijpesteijn first suggested in ZPE 56 (1984) without the image ἅπερ α]ὐτόθι, but then received an image and corrected into ἅ α]υτόθι in ZPE 55 (1984). ZPE 55 (1984) was written later and is considered  final by Sijpesteijn, but it was not added in BL. On the basis of the space available on the papyrus, ἅ is more likely.</change>
